id=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9WadEWQ4k1sQ7kNvwFwuGDG&_nc_oc=AdorJo1WZzsPIDFkwt1x15EFWvcqHK5m7pBI4kPY0039EiDLHEqiqVoqVqjG8Pqr6TU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4b3tfHgvawcIotoDsM0mmtNPCYhkE3QqkzQwF1ki89QA&oe=69FC7FA4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_meta-store_Trailer-Cover-Image.png", "id": "6477503358931451", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222937_6477503362264784_6203451220098661937_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CZ8Ol-5uNoQ7kNvwH5jhoP&_nc_oc=AdquiBkBPirosML1wi6IUXOAaZrQW3fbrfZJyvE_6tn6PAWcBQR4BHtq88QwiObrltE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4zM2qP2fnDIRqYUoPsHo21ssJ6XALPCObnTpnPBLSMUg&oe=69FC7CF1"}, "display_name": "Flipside Studio", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "cartoon", "streaming"], "long_description": "Turn any room into a stage with Flipside Studio!\n\nPacked with features, Flipside Studio is a virtual production studio that allows creators to use VR to make real-time animated shows for Twitch, YouTube, TikTok, and more.\n\nShare your live-streamed or recorded adventure, comedy, family entertainment or talk show series\u2026Your only limit is your imagination!\n- Choose from pre-loaded characters, sets, and 100's of props\n- Create characters in-app using Ready Player Me\n- Use show tools like cameras, teleprompters, monitors, slideshows, and more\n- Capture actor and prop movement as full spatial motion capture recordings that can be seen from any angle\n- Create on your own or collaborate remotely in-real time with folks world-wide\n- Stream online, on social, Zoom, and more with the free Flipside Broadcaster (PC) companion app\n- Customize characters, sets, props and effects with the free Unity plug-in, Flipside Creator Tools\n\nDownload Flipside Studio today. Visit www.flipsidexr.com for free tools and tips.\n", "short_description": "Turn any room into a stage with Flipside Studio!\n\nPacke